WEBVTT

00:00:00.960 --> 00:00:02.260
I found it! Over there!

00:00:02.560 --> 00:00:03.790
Hoi! Joso!

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:05.330
Ketsu!

00:00:06.170 --> 00:00:08.800
What were you thinking?!

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:11.940
You'll need extra lives if
you keep fighting like that...

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:14.930
Yoshi, you've got to stay quick
during a challenge!

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:17.480
Hey, Tokine, are you okay?

00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:22.180
High school student Yukimura Tokine and
junior high student Sumimura Yoshimori

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:24.020
are ordinary students by day.

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:29.120
But at night, their mission is to
protect the Karasumori Site,

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:31.290
where the school now stands.
From the Ayakashi.

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:35.090
I will become stronger!

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:39.020
I never want to see her hurt again!

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:59.760
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:01.620
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:06.830
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:01:06.830 --> 00:01:08.730
(Fighting late into the night)

00:01:09.230 --> 00:01:12.170
Drive away all hesitation

00:01:12.170 --> 00:01:16.570
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:01:16.740 --> 00:01:20.110
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:01:20.110 --> 00:01:23.450
I will protect you that's all
(that's all I want)

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:29.110
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:33.620
Sha la la la la...

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:40.030
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:01:40.030 --> 00:01:42.000
(Secret romance)

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:47.200
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:48.970
(A strange distance)

00:01:49.440 --> 00:01:55.810
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:01:55.880 --> 00:01:56.880
Yeah

00:01:56.880 --> 00:02:00.350
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:02:00.350 --> 00:02:03.950
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:02:03.950 --> 00:02:09.290
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:02:22.140 --> 00:02:24.400
What is the Shadow Organization?

00:02:24.570 --> 00:02:28.140
The Shadow Organization is an autonomous
syndicate of Specially-Talented people

00:02:28.140 --> 00:02:31.980
formed by the Specially-Talented,
expressly for the Specially-Talented.

00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:34.250
I don't get it.

00:02:34.580 --> 00:02:37.890
Their main job is organizing people
with special powers as well as

00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:40.450
taking care of the incidents that
cannot be allowed to go public.

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:45.430
In the old days, when the darkness
was more profound,

00:02:45.430 --> 00:02:47.590
supernatural things were
a common occurrence.

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:51.400
In order to deal with those incidents
in an organized way,

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:55.840
groups of the Specially-Talented
were designated for each region.

00:02:55.870 --> 00:02:57.600
That is what the Shadow Organization
was originally.

00:02:58.110 --> 00:03:00.410
They even have
a headquarters somewhere

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:02.430
and manage every member
throughout the nation.

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:05.280
So they're not exactly our enemies?

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:08.470
Your name is also registered
in the Shadow Organization's list.

00:03:08.520 --> 00:03:09.710
Really?

00:03:10.220 --> 00:03:13.750
So what is my big bro doing
in the Shadow Organization?

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:17.510
There is a group within the organization
called the Night Troops.

00:03:18.230 --> 00:03:24.390
They are the special forces that act under
the direct orders of the Shadow Organization.

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:27.590
Masamori is the chief of that group.

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:31.700
The two we saw last time
probably serve under Masamori.

00:03:32.170 --> 00:03:37.080
The Night Troops can be
a hot-blooded bunch.

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:40.380
But either way,
you are the Legitimate Heir,

00:03:40.380 --> 00:03:42.410
so the Shadow Organization will not
have anything to do with you.

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:44.610
What do you mean by that?

00:03:45.390 --> 00:03:48.220
The Shadow Organization is
comprised of outcasts

00:03:48.220 --> 00:03:51.090
who could not legitimately
succeed their families.

00:04:08.740 --> 00:04:11.540
All right! You're perfect,
my sweet little meringue!

00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:20.450
You're still pretending
to be a Westerner?!

00:04:20.490 --> 00:04:24.290
There you are, you troll!
I'll put you down once and for all!

00:04:24.460 --> 00:04:28.290
Go ahead and try!

00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:31.830
I'll show you just how
inexperienced you really are!

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:32.860
Ketsu!

00:04:33.070 --> 00:04:35.940
What the-?! What are you doing?!
I'll just...

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:43.970
Can't you even dispel
a Kekkai of this level?

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:45.640
You are so inexperienced!

00:04:45.910 --> 00:04:50.540
Now then. Time for
a thorough inspection.

00:04:51.490 --> 00:04:53.920
Hey! You better not touch that!

00:04:56.660 --> 00:04:57.990
W-Wait a second!

00:04:58.390 --> 00:05:00.490
So this is the blueprint for
your foreign sweets.

00:05:01.760 --> 00:05:06.170
You have better things to do
than wasteful things like this!

00:05:11.640 --> 00:05:12.730
Now go train.

00:05:19.850 --> 00:05:21.840
This is unforgivable!

00:05:22.150 --> 00:05:24.640
It's all because of this Kekkai...

00:05:26.120 --> 00:05:28.110
I won't let you get away with this!

00:05:30.490 --> 00:05:32.390
It's another peaceful day.

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:40.430
What's wrong?
You seem to be in a bad mood.

00:05:40.470 --> 00:05:43.340
Yoshi, did something bad happen?

00:05:43.370 --> 00:05:45.740
Shut up! It's just lack of sleep!

00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:47.070
Yoshimori! Up ahead!

00:05:50.180 --> 00:05:51.670
Why, you-

00:05:52.350 --> 00:05:54.650
Hoi! Joso! Ketsu!

00:05:54.920 --> 00:05:56.080
Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:05:56.350 --> 00:05:58.480
Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:05:58.720 --> 00:06:00.980
You have terrible aim!

00:06:01.020 --> 00:06:02.960
I'm going to take it
for myself if you won't.

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:05.090
Crap!

00:06:06.660 --> 00:06:07.650
Ketsu!

00:06:12.730 --> 00:06:13.390
Metsu!

00:06:15.240 --> 00:06:18.300
You're using too much power
on the small fry again!

00:06:18.840 --> 00:06:20.400
You've still got lots to work on!

00:06:20.680 --> 00:06:21.970
You're right...

00:06:22.280 --> 00:06:22.940
Huh?

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:26.210
I'm thinking of making it
less sweet next time.

00:06:26.350 --> 00:06:27.610
What are you talking about?

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:30.220
You know. A more "mature" taste...

00:06:32.420 --> 00:06:36.080
So you couldn't concentrate
because of some cake?

00:06:36.320 --> 00:06:39.420
N-No! It's not like that!

00:06:39.590 --> 00:06:42.260
You can't take our duties as
a Kekkaishi seriously?!

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:45.260
Enough already, you cake otaku!

00:06:46.070 --> 00:06:47.060
Let's go, Hakubi!

00:06:48.070 --> 00:06:51.400
See ya, Yoshi.
Good luck with your cake making!

00:06:52.910 --> 00:06:54.710
Cake otaku?

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:06.850
Hey Sumimura!

00:07:07.690 --> 00:07:08.350
'Morning.

00:07:09.020 --> 00:07:10.250
That face!

00:07:10.660 --> 00:07:12.090
According to my data,

00:07:12.090 --> 00:07:15.360
Sumimura has a 98% chance
of sleeping during class

00:07:15.360 --> 00:07:17.730
when he makes such
a huge yawn in the morning.

00:07:17.970 --> 00:07:19.830
I'm guessing you're going
to sleep through class again?

00:07:19.940 --> 00:07:21.030
I'm not going to.

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:23.970
I have my next blueprint
to draw up... Hm?

00:07:24.570 --> 00:07:27.010
Ugh there's one...
first thing in the morning.

00:07:27.940 --> 00:07:28.930
What's wrong?

00:07:28.980 --> 00:07:30.710
Sorry. Can you two
go ahead without me?

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:31.670
Sure...

00:07:36.920 --> 00:07:38.220
Huh? Me?!

00:07:41.190 --> 00:07:43.520
Great! Finally!

00:07:43.830 --> 00:07:46.450
I don't know why,
but everyone keeps ignoring me.

00:07:46.660 --> 00:07:50.620
I'm sorry, but you shouldn't be here.

00:07:50.670 --> 00:07:52.390
Would you please leave
this place at once?

00:07:52.500 --> 00:07:56.800
What? I don't really get it,
but I have to go back to the store anyway.

00:07:57.440 --> 00:08:01.470
Huh? Does this person...

00:08:01.940 --> 00:08:04.710
I wonder why I'm at this school, anyway.

00:08:05.050 --> 00:08:07.310
Does this person not realize he's dead?!

00:08:07.820 --> 00:08:10.010
Excuse me, but please listen carefully!

00:08:10.550 --> 00:08:12.450
You're... already dead.

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:19.590
Sorry! I don't know how to react
when you joke like that.

00:08:19.960 --> 00:08:21.590
I said, listen carefully!

00:08:22.200 --> 00:08:26.690
Why are you mad? I don't get you!
Though we just met.

00:08:26.740 --> 00:08:27.900
Just get out of here!

00:08:28.900 --> 00:08:32.740
What's with you? You don't
have to look so mad! I'll go!

00:08:33.340 --> 00:08:34.470
Hey wait.

00:08:35.840 --> 00:08:37.240
Please go here.

00:08:37.480 --> 00:08:39.410
This is like a consulting office for
wandering ghosts like you.

00:08:39.810 --> 00:08:42.780
There will be someone called
Mother-san that can help you.

00:08:42.820 --> 00:08:44.720
M-Mother-san?

00:08:44.850 --> 00:08:45.890
Okay. Now get out of here.

00:08:45.890 --> 00:08:47.590
- Out. Out. Out!
- What's with you?

00:08:47.590 --> 00:08:49.490
I still don't understand
what you're getting at!

00:08:54.730 --> 00:08:59.360
I was going to draw up another blueprint
but ended up sleeping.

00:08:59.830 --> 00:09:02.330
I should go to that place to
get myself motivated!

00:09:07.710 --> 00:09:09.770
Wow.

00:09:10.450 --> 00:09:12.470
It's so beautiful.

00:09:12.610 --> 00:09:14.980
What, you like sweets?

00:09:15.180 --> 00:09:17.120
Yeah. I love them.

00:09:18.420 --> 00:09:20.410
I like this store too.

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:23.280
They put a lot of work into the appearance,
but they also taste very...

00:09:25.230 --> 00:09:28.020
Don't appear behind me out of nowhere!

00:09:28.060 --> 00:09:32.020
Hey! What kind of person chops someone
on the head out of nowhere?!

00:09:32.430 --> 00:09:35.490
Did you already forget
what I told you this morning?!

00:09:35.900 --> 00:09:37.900
I told you to go to Mother-san!

00:09:38.570 --> 00:09:40.560
- What's going on?
- Who is he talking to?

00:09:40.610 --> 00:09:42.040
That's very creepy.

00:09:42.280 --> 00:09:46.180
W-Wait! This again?! I did go!

00:09:46.380 --> 00:09:48.510
And did you listen to her?!

00:09:48.850 --> 00:09:52.910
Well... that old lady was
a nice person, but...

00:09:57.760 --> 00:10:00.020
You're dead.

00:10:00.400 --> 00:10:02.630
Yup, I'm dead.

00:10:03.570 --> 00:10:04.220
Wait. What?

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:06.700
I said you're dead.

00:10:06.740 --> 00:10:08.940
Yup... Wait!

00:10:08.940 --> 00:10:10.460
Like I said...

00:10:10.740 --> 00:10:13.610
Our conversation just
went in circles.

00:10:13.810 --> 00:10:16.280
So you still don't understand
the situation you're in?

00:10:16.650 --> 00:10:22.240
Oh, don't worry about that part.
I already understand that I'm dead.

00:10:24.790 --> 00:10:27.620
Now that you mention it,
I can't see my reflection in the glass.

00:10:28.120 --> 00:10:29.890
I can't touch anything either.

00:10:31.590 --> 00:10:32.620
But you...

00:10:32.830 --> 00:10:33.490
Me?

00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:35.490
How are you able to touch me?

00:10:37.130 --> 00:10:41.400
A Kekkaishi? So if you're
a Kekkaishi, you can touch ghosts?

00:10:41.600 --> 00:10:42.260
Yeah.

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:46.910
You're a ghost with no Negative Energy,
so I don't need to destroy you,

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:49.710
but there's a chance that you'll
transform if you stay at the school.

00:10:49.740 --> 00:10:51.580
You have to stay away from there,
no matter what.

00:10:52.050 --> 00:10:54.610
Transform? Then I have to go!

00:10:54.850 --> 00:10:57.580
You idiot! Don't go!
Do you hear me?

00:10:58.020 --> 00:11:01.220
If you do, I'll have to terminate you.

00:11:03.120 --> 00:11:04.320
Terminate?

00:11:04.690 --> 00:11:06.680
Now please go rest in peace.

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:07.590
Huh?

00:11:07.630 --> 00:11:12.070
Hold on a sec! I can't die like this!

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:13.570
You're already dead.

00:11:13.600 --> 00:11:17.330
I just remembered my very last words.

00:11:35.060 --> 00:11:36.990
Cabbage...

00:11:41.730 --> 00:11:42.860
My last words were "cabbage"!

00:11:42.900 --> 00:11:46.200
That makes it look like
my entire life was about cabbage!

00:11:46.230 --> 00:11:47.260
That's your problem!

00:11:47.300 --> 00:11:48.460
I can't stay dead like this!

00:11:48.500 --> 00:11:50.490
At the very least, I want my last words
to be "strawberry" or something!

00:11:50.540 --> 00:11:51.730
Why?!

00:11:52.170 --> 00:11:55.840
That's right. I was a pâtissier.

00:11:56.340 --> 00:11:59.010
A pâtissier?
Who makes sweets?

00:11:59.410 --> 00:12:02.610
Yeah. That's why I dress like this.

00:12:03.450 --> 00:12:05.040
Whoa!

00:12:11.030 --> 00:12:13.890
Pointers from a pro can be so helpful.

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:15.120
I really have to thank you.

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:19.800
No problem. But your dream is to
make a castle out of sweets?

00:12:19.830 --> 00:12:21.430
That seems rare in this day and age.

00:12:22.800 --> 00:12:24.700
There's someone I want to give it to.

00:12:25.640 --> 00:12:27.370
Someone really special to you?

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:33.510
Yeah...

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:37.620
Sweets are so good.

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:42.250
It can make people happy.

00:12:42.620 --> 00:12:47.860
Plus. It makes me feel warm inside
whenever I see other people smile.

00:12:48.600 --> 00:12:52.460
But... I can't do that anymore.

00:12:52.970 --> 00:12:54.030
Well... that's...

00:12:56.170 --> 00:12:56.830
Hey!

00:12:57.670 --> 00:12:59.330
What are you doing?!

00:13:00.580 --> 00:13:02.300
I. Uh...

00:13:02.340 --> 00:13:04.280
- Get over here!
- Ow! You'll pull my ear off!

00:13:04.780 --> 00:13:07.910
Why are you being so friendly
with a ghost?

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:10.120
Don't you know that human ghosts
can be big trouble?!

00:13:10.650 --> 00:13:13.180
Besides, I can feel that his energy
is pretty strong, too.

00:13:13.490 --> 00:13:14.480
He's dangerous.

00:13:14.860 --> 00:13:17.920
That's why I explained to him why
he should stay away from the school.

00:13:18.390 --> 00:13:20.690
Can you see me?

00:13:20.830 --> 00:13:21.990
Hey! Stop it!

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:24.860
She's also a Kekkaishi. But. Unlike me.
She can be really ruthless and-

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:27.830
Who're you calling ruthless?!

00:13:28.070 --> 00:13:30.970
I'm not going to bother myself
with such a low-level ghost.

00:13:31.440 --> 00:13:33.340
But let me tell you something.

00:13:33.740 --> 00:13:36.570
Just forget about all your regrets
and move on to the next world.

00:13:36.950 --> 00:13:39.640
You don't belong to this world anymore.

00:13:40.720 --> 00:13:42.150
What do you mean?

00:13:42.980 --> 00:13:47.390
People's hearts and bodies can be
affected just by having a ghost nearby.

00:13:47.760 --> 00:13:50.190
We have resistance. So we're fine...

00:13:51.290 --> 00:13:53.090
But you're dangerous.

00:13:54.560 --> 00:13:57.930
You should get it in your head that
you're nothing but a monster.

00:13:59.630 --> 00:14:02.070
Hey! You didn't have to say it like that!

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:03.600
Let's go, Yoshimori.

00:14:03.640 --> 00:14:04.800
Ow! A-Anyway...

00:14:04.840 --> 00:14:08.610
Don't go near the school! Ever!
Do you hear me?!

00:14:26.860 --> 00:14:31.820
Tokine is right.
His spirit needs to move on.

00:14:34.670 --> 00:14:38.040
Yoshimori! We have trouble
within the site!

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:40.070
Yeah. I know.

00:14:40.580 --> 00:14:41.970
This isn't an Ayakashi.

00:14:42.240 --> 00:14:45.370
It's something or someone that
turned evil after being inside there.

00:14:51.020 --> 00:14:52.420
Could it be him?!

00:15:11.110 --> 00:15:13.970
You seem really motivated.
Now that's rare.

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:15.600
Shut up and let's go!

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:20.300
He looked so shocked when
she called him a monster...

00:15:20.920 --> 00:15:23.180
He must have gotten desperate
and went to the school!

00:15:27.960 --> 00:15:29.320
Yoohoo!

00:15:31.690 --> 00:15:35.790
W-Wha-?! What are you doing?!

00:15:36.130 --> 00:15:38.930
Hmm... some yoga.

00:15:39.100 --> 00:15:42.400
That's not what I meant!
I thought I told you not to come here.

00:15:42.440 --> 00:15:46.100
People always have this urge
to do what's forbidden.

00:15:46.310 --> 00:15:49.330
When I was called a monster.
I started thinking about it.

00:15:49.380 --> 00:15:51.610
But living the life of a monster
actually isn't all that bad.

00:15:52.550 --> 00:15:54.310
Th-The life of a monster?

00:15:54.350 --> 00:15:55.550
You can fly anywhere you want,

00:15:55.550 --> 00:15:57.350
and you know how
normal people can't see me?

00:15:57.390 --> 00:16:02.620
I get to go peeping as much as I want!

00:16:04.060 --> 00:16:07.930
You're... you're...

00:16:08.030 --> 00:16:09.390
What's up, missy?!

00:16:10.060 --> 00:16:12.460
You're still here?

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:14.800
Just let it be.
He's just small fry anyway.

00:16:15.070 --> 00:16:20.510
Oh my! You got one rude
talking doggy right there!

00:16:20.940 --> 00:16:23.540
That evil I felt
didn't come from him.

00:16:23.780 --> 00:16:26.910
Yes. The culprit is inside
the school building.

00:16:33.090 --> 00:16:34.520
You take care of him!

00:16:35.790 --> 00:16:37.190
Hey wait!

00:16:38.030 --> 00:16:40.220
Oh fine. You! Follow me.

00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:41.680
You sure?

00:16:42.100 --> 00:16:44.460
You probably won't leave
even if I tell you to.

00:16:45.100 --> 00:16:48.400
If some Ayakashi comes inside here,
you might get eaten!

00:16:57.250 --> 00:17:00.370
Feels like it's getting dangerous!

00:17:00.420 --> 00:17:02.040
This isn't a game!

00:17:02.280 --> 00:17:03.810
Shut up, both of you!

00:17:03.850 --> 00:17:05.510
I can't concentrate!

00:17:05.720 --> 00:17:08.710
But I've never seen
a monster before!

00:17:08.760 --> 00:17:10.780
This isn't a monster!

00:17:11.030 --> 00:17:12.720
I'm pretty sure it's a ghost!

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:19.070
It prefers to be indoors,
could it be a human ghost?

00:17:20.400 --> 00:17:24.000
Seems like it. The smell is weak because
it's still in the early stage.

00:17:24.440 --> 00:17:25.430
It's in the early stages?

00:17:25.570 --> 00:17:27.770
It doesn't seem to have
fully transformed yet.

00:17:28.510 --> 00:17:30.030
I found it. Yoshimori! Over there!

00:17:36.880 --> 00:17:37.870
I don't see it.

00:17:38.350 --> 00:17:40.220
The scent is really weak.

00:17:40.720 --> 00:17:42.020
Perfect timing.

00:17:43.690 --> 00:17:46.180
I was looking for someone like you.

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:54.860
A live human to test these scissors on...

00:17:55.670 --> 00:17:57.190
Tokine! I'll do it!

00:17:58.840 --> 00:18:01.470
Looks like we have more people now.

00:18:01.740 --> 00:18:04.680
Let me take care of you one by one.

00:18:08.350 --> 00:18:09.910
That dude is dangerous!

00:18:10.150 --> 00:18:12.920
You don't have a body, so you can feel
his Negative Energy directly!

00:18:13.250 --> 00:18:14.240
Stand back!

00:18:14.720 --> 00:18:18.590
I'm so unlucky...

00:18:19.860 --> 00:18:24.230
I worked 25 years at my company
without causing any problems.

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:28.690
Yet I got laid off so suddenly.
Don't you think that's horrible?

00:18:29.200 --> 00:18:30.860
That's why I decided...

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:35.170
That I will be the one
to cut people off now.

00:18:36.180 --> 00:18:37.170
Metsu!

00:18:44.390 --> 00:18:46.110
Do you want to be erased?

00:18:47.920 --> 00:18:49.080
Ketsu! Metsu!

00:18:50.790 --> 00:18:51.920
Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:18:52.030 --> 00:18:53.650
Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:18:53.960 --> 00:18:55.330
Metsu! Metsu!

00:18:55.360 --> 00:18:57.590
Metsu! Metsu! Metsu!

00:18:58.530 --> 00:19:01.260
Wow... that kid might be
the more dangerous one...

00:19:01.470 --> 00:19:02.990
Yoshimori! You can't!

00:19:03.040 --> 00:19:04.870
Once a spirit becomes evil,
they can't go back to normal!

00:19:05.110 --> 00:19:06.940
Shut up! It's not too late!

00:19:08.740 --> 00:19:11.370
Hey you! I won't tell you twice.

00:19:11.550 --> 00:19:13.840
Get out of here! That's an order.

00:19:17.990 --> 00:19:22.050
I'm so unlucky...
I'm so very unlucky...

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:23.310
Hey...

00:19:24.630 --> 00:19:27.150
Didn't you have something good happen
to you when you were still alive?

00:19:27.300 --> 00:19:30.990
Something good?
I can't think of anything...

00:19:31.130 --> 00:19:32.790
Then what about stuff
that made you happy?

00:19:33.370 --> 00:19:34.600
Well...

00:19:35.970 --> 00:19:39.000
When I was hired at my company,
I was happy.

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:45.640
My marriage was arranged,
so I don't have much to say about that...

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:47.570
You know...

00:19:47.680 --> 00:19:49.080
Oh but...

00:19:49.520 --> 00:19:53.250
I felt very happy when
my daughter was born.

00:19:53.590 --> 00:19:55.250
What is she doing now?

00:19:55.560 --> 00:20:00.890
Huh? I don't know...
I was here when I came to my senses...

00:20:01.600 --> 00:20:03.190
Do you want to see her?

00:20:03.430 --> 00:20:06.490
Huh? She used to be very attached to me.

00:20:06.730 --> 00:20:09.700
Back then, she would gladly eat
the birthday cake I bought her!

00:20:10.240 --> 00:20:13.770
But when she entered junior high school,
she stopped talking to me...

00:20:14.810 --> 00:20:17.070
Even so... I want to see her...

00:20:17.450 --> 00:20:18.100
Good!

00:20:19.910 --> 00:20:24.150
Go here. It's a consulting center
for wandering ghosts.

00:20:24.690 --> 00:20:27.420
Tell the chief. Mother-san.
That you want to see your daughter.

00:20:28.120 --> 00:20:29.820
And don't ever come near
this place again.

00:20:30.490 --> 00:20:32.830
The next time you come,
you will be swallowed

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:36.420
into a pit of darkness
without even a speck of light.

00:20:36.900 --> 00:20:38.590
Now go!

00:20:39.030 --> 00:20:42.030
Okay! I'm off!

00:20:42.570 --> 00:20:43.660
You're too easy on them.

00:20:44.210 --> 00:20:46.470
But I guess it was good that
you didn't have to destroy him.

00:20:46.940 --> 00:20:49.340
That really surprised me back there!

00:20:49.580 --> 00:20:53.510
You threatened him so suddenly,
I thought you were a really scary guy!

00:20:53.850 --> 00:21:01.020
Well, I was never laid off from my job,
so I didn't know how to explain it to him.

00:21:01.620 --> 00:21:04.820
I also used to be really negative
when I was younger.

00:21:05.260 --> 00:21:07.020
That's why I just couldn't
blame him for being like that.

00:21:07.430 --> 00:21:10.660
But you're really interesting!

00:21:10.730 --> 00:21:13.330
Whatever. You need to leave
this world as soon as possible!

00:21:13.900 --> 00:21:19.430
Well yeah. I finally remembered
what I loved, so I'll be going now.

00:21:20.170 --> 00:21:22.540
Hey missy.
You're one lucky gal.

00:21:23.080 --> 00:21:26.140
He's going to feed you
some really nice cake!

00:21:26.410 --> 00:21:27.470
Uh. What?

00:21:28.480 --> 00:21:30.510
Just go! Get out of here!

00:21:30.720 --> 00:21:35.710
Sure thing!
Woo-hoo! So hot!

00:21:35.760 --> 00:21:38.620
Crap! I should have destroyed him
when I had the chance!

00:21:38.890 --> 00:21:39.550
Hey...

00:21:40.430 --> 00:21:44.130
If you're going to make
some cake anyway, I'd like to try some.

00:21:45.100 --> 00:21:46.120
S-Sure...

00:21:55.240 --> 00:21:57.270
Only a little more
until I'm done.

00:22:00.750 --> 00:22:03.340
Wow! You're really good!

00:22:03.520 --> 00:22:04.510
You!

00:22:04.890 --> 00:22:09.980
Hear me out. I really tried,
but it's hard to leave this world.

00:22:11.060 --> 00:22:12.390
Yoshimori!

00:22:13.190 --> 00:22:15.630
Uh-oh! My grandfather attacks
indiscriminately!

00:22:16.100 --> 00:22:17.530
Hurry up and get out of here!

00:22:17.630 --> 00:22:20.260
You're making these things again?

00:22:20.400 --> 00:22:21.560
Huh?

00:22:22.670 --> 00:22:23.760
Hiya.

00:22:24.170 --> 00:22:26.140
Be gone evil spirit!

00:22:26.170 --> 00:22:29.510
Why won't you hurry up and
move on to the next world?!

00:22:32.210 --> 00:22:36.210
The slightly odd human ghost is
still wandering around in this world...

00:22:38.690 --> 00:22:46.390
The breeze blows past us
in this city we know so well

00:22:46.390 --> 00:22:53.100
The two of us both walk at our usual pace

00:22:54.670 --> 00:23:02.480
Joking around I noticed after I laughed

00:23:02.480 --> 00:23:08.810
Your mature look that
I had never seen before

00:23:10.750 --> 00:23:18.660
You don't have to say anything it's okay

00:23:19.960 --> 00:23:25.020
I'm not mistaking these feelings

00:23:26.600 --> 00:23:34.110
Straight ahead I'm pushing forward

00:23:34.110 --> 00:23:41.640
Yet I can't help but keep gazing at you

00:23:43.380 --> 00:23:50.620
Even if we are near or far

00:23:50.620 --> 00:23:59.190
The red string connects one to another
